This seems to be crashing the R process:

FcCacheFini: Assertion `fcCacheChains[i] == NULL' failed.

Is it possible libfontconfig1 (Ubuntu) or fontconfig/fontconfig-devel (Red Hat) were recently updated? You may have to rebuild R packages that linked against it.

