Hi Joao,

I think I understand what you are saying now. However, I don't experience that problem: I always see the 6 tabsetPanels. I even tried it using shiny's CRAN version (instead of the current devel version) to see if this had been a bug that is now fixed. However, both of them work as expected for me.

I suggest you do this:
Re-install shiny and restart your R session to get a completely clean environment. Hopefully that solves whatever weirdness you were experiencing.
If not, could you try to create a more minimal example so I can debug it? As is, your code is too complicated for me to try to understand what could be the issue... This might not be a problem if I could replicate the bug, but since I can't, I have no idea what could be wrong here...
Good luck!
Barbara

