> > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > I just found your post here.  We've recently been dealing with the same issue, and it is actually now crippling our application.
> > > > > > > > > > >
> > > > > > > > > > > For our situation, we are putting together a series of tags to create buttons and tiles.  The average time to create just a part of each tile using tags is 3.83s.  To create the same exact HTML by using only text takes 0.14s per item -- but of course, creating them with raw text is not clean and it's not the right way to do it.
> > > > > > > > > > >
