It's possible there's just a bug in Shiny, I guess?

I'd be interested to see a code sketch of what you mean by "incrementing progress through a group of reactive objects". We didn't intend for people to do that; even though one continuous progress bar across multiple reactives is an optimal user experience, as you're seeing it's just hard to code correctly (even in an imperative environment, much less a reactive one), and we were not able to figure out how to abstract that complexity away in a nice way.

